# Local Claude Code session data (covers gocache*/gotmp* used by GOCACHE/GOTMPDIR)
/.claude/

# The HTTP/3 conformance peer's binary, built in place by `go build ./...`
# in its module (the clean-build CI job does this).
/http3/interop/interop

# Test binaries that `go test -c` leaves in a package directory.
*.test

# Local tool output and Go build cache.
.VSCodeCounter/
.gocache/
